<header class="herb-diagnostic-header"><span class="herb-severity-label herb-severity-error">error</span> <span class="herb-diagnostic-message">Nested <code>&lt;form&gt;</code> elements are not allowed. At least one call site renders this file inside a <code>&lt;form&gt;</code>.</span> <span class="herb-diagnostic-code">(<a href="https://herb-tools.dev/linter/rules/html-no-nested-forms" rel="noopener noreferrer">html-no-nested-forms</a>)</span></header>
<figcaption class="herb-file-header"><a href="file:///private/project/app/views/posts/_actions.html.erb" rel="noopener noreferrer">app/views/posts/_actions.html.erb:1:1</a></figcaption>
<pre class="herb-code"><code><span class="herb-line herb-line-marked" data-line="1" data-herb-severity="error"><span class="herb-line-number" data-line="1">1</span><span class="herb-token-html-tag-start">&lt;</span><mark class="herb-marker herb-marker-error"><span class="herb-tag-name">form</span></mark><span class="herb-token-whitespace"> </span><span class="herb-attr-name">action</span><span class="herb-token-equals">=</span><span class="herb-attr-value">&quot;</span><span class="herb-token-slash">/</span><span class="herb-attr-value">posts</span><span class="herb-token-slash">/</span><span class="herb-attr-value">1</span><span class="herb-attr-value">&quot;</span><span class="herb-token-whitespace"> </span><span class="herb-attr-name">method</span><span class="herb-token-equals">=</span><span class="herb-attr-value">&quot;</span><span class="herb-attr-value">post</span><span class="herb-attr-value">&quot;</span><span class="herb-token-html-tag-end">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="herb-line herb-line-dimmed" data-line="2"><span class="herb-line-number" data-line="2">2</span><span class="herb-token-whitespace">  </span><span class="herb-token-html-tag-start">&lt;</span><span class="herb-tag-name">button</span><span class="herb-token-whitespace"> </span><span class="herb-attr-name">type</span><span class="herb-token-equals">=</span><span class="herb-attr-value">&quot;</span><span class="herb-attr-value">submit</span><span class="herb-attr-value">&quot;</span><span class="herb-token-html-tag-end">&gt;</span><span class="herb-token-identifier">Delete</span><span class="herb-token-html-tag-start-close">&lt;/</span><span class="herb-tag-name">button</span><span class="herb-token-html-tag-end">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="herb-line herb-line-dimmed" data-line="3"><span class="herb-line-number" data-line="3">3</span><span class="herb-token-html-tag-start-close">&lt;/</span><span class="herb-tag-name">form</span><span class="herb-token-html-tag-end">&gt;</span></span></code></pre>
</figure>
</div>
